  "positioning": {
    "en": "The E-Series is designed for standardized, high-volume PCB manufacturing. Combining dependable reflow performance, durable identification, and consistent supply, it helps manufacturers achieve efficient production and reliable traceability at scale.",
    "zh": "E 系列专为标准化、高产量 PCB 制造设计。结合可靠的回流焊表现、持久的标识与稳定的供货，助力制造商实现规模化的高效生产与可靠追溯。",
    "vi": "Dòng E được thiết kế cho sản xuất PCB tiêu chuẩn hóa, số lượng lớn. Kết hợp hiệu năng hàn hồi lưu đáng tin cậy, nhận diện bền và nguồn cung ổn định, giúp nhà sản xuất đạt hiệu quả sản xuất và truy xuất đáng tin cậy ở quy mô lớn.",
    "th": "ซีรีส์ E ออกแบบมาเพื่อการผลิต PCB มาตรฐานปริมาณมาก ผสานประสิทธิภาพรีโฟลว์ที่ไว้ใจได้ การระบุที่ทนทาน และการจัดหาที่สม่ำเสมอ ช่วยให้ผู้ผลิตบรรลุการผลิตที่มีประสิทธิภาพและการตรวจสอบย้อนกลับที่เชื่อถือได้ในระดับใหญ่"
  },
  "eyebrow": {
    "en": "E-Series",
    "zh": "E 系列",
    "vi": "Dòng E",
    "th": "ซีรีส์ E"
  },
  "features": {
    "en": [
      "Four product lines — general, high-adhesion, removable, and ESD — covering every mainstream PCB scenario",
      "20 standardized, in-stock models with no non-standard customization required",
      "Polyimide construction stable through standard reflow soldering, with select models to 350°C",
      "Consistent thermal-transfer print quality with mainstream ribbon compatibility",
      "ESD line with static-dissipative surface to protect sensitive components",
      "RoHS compliant",
      "Local ready stock and rapid replenishment for uninterrupted high-volume production"
    ],
    "zh": [
      "四大产品线 —— 通用、高附着、可移除、ESD 防静电，覆盖各类主流 PCB 场景",
      "20 款标准化现货型号，无需非标定制",
      "聚酰亚胺结构，稳定通过标准回流焊，部分型号耐受 350°C",
      "热转印打印质量稳定，兼容主流碳带",
      "ESD 产品线采用静电消散面材，保护敏感元器件",
      "符合 RoHS",
      "本地常备现货、快速补货，保障高产量不间断生产"
    ],
    "vi": [
      "Bốn dòng sản phẩm — phổ thông, độ bám cao, tháo rời và ESD — bao phủ mọi tình huống PCB phổ biến",
      "20 mẫu tiêu chuẩn có sẵn, không cần tùy chỉnh phi chuẩn",
      "Cấu tạo polyimide ổn định qua hàn hồi lưu tiêu chuẩn, một số mẫu chịu đến 350°C",
      "Chất lượng in truyền nhiệt nhất quán, tương thích ribbon phổ biến",
